56
00:07:42.837 --> 00:07:43.671
Ginang To!

57
00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:54.015
Lalamigin ka.

58
00:07:56.350 --> 00:07:58.436
Kailangan mo munang magpalit ng damit.

59
00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:01.522
Lumabas sa araw
at lumanghap ng sariwang hangin

60
